{
  "_comment": [
    "Seed lists for scripts/build-tag-taxonomy.mjs. The RSS keywords arrive lowercased, so",
    "there is no casing signal to separate 'jeff lemire' from 'sweet tooth' — a term is a",
    "creator because it appears in a list of creators, not because it looks like a name.",
    "",
    "Anything not matched here and not matching a series falls to `topic`, which is the",
    "reviewable bucket. Add a name here rather than editing the taxonomy by hand, so a",
    "re-run keeps the classification.",
    "",
    "`aliases` merges the vocabulary: the feed carries six spellings of the Goodreads segment",
    "and two of Marvel, which would otherwise be six and two separate facets."
  ],
